[[1,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in the\nOFF postition, then disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3023729\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>1. Disconnect electrical connections (1a) and (1b) from the injection-ignition\ncontrol unit.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Engine management ECU</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024412\">M10A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Engine management ECU</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024418\">M10B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Release the electrical wiring from the fastening on the ignition/injection\nsystem control unit mount.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001608.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,63,0,"<p>1. Undo nuts (1a) and remove the single injection/ignition control\nunit (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001609.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,63,0,